      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَدَجَهُ بِشَىْءٍ</span></b> , (O, K,) aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَدُجَ</span></b> , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَدْجٌ</span>,
(TK,) <i>He thought a thing to be in him;</i> (O, K;)
i. e. <i>he suspected him of a thing:</i> (TA:) or
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَدَجَ بِشَىْءٍ</span> <i>he imagined,</i> or <i>thought, a thing.</i>
(L.) ― 
